            "source_segment_index": 1768,
            "start_ms": 3655710,
            "end_ms": 3657270,
            "text": "本级版行为孤注一掷"
          },
          {
            "index": 1769,
            "source_segment_index": 1769,
            "start_ms": 3657270,
            "end_ms": 3660230,
            "text": "深圳阵营预言家9号犹如10号圣梦人"
          },
          {
